OL,3,GNEWSABomb squad called to Larkhall as
OL,4,Apremises evacuated and streets closed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bomb disposal team has been called to
OL,7,FLarkhall after "possible ordnance" was
OL,8,Ffound in the area.
OL,10,FStreets been closed off and local
OL,11,Fpremises evacuated after the discovery
OL,12,Fon Broomhill Road, which happened just
OL,13,Fafter 09:00.
OL,15,FBroomhill Road and Broomhill Drive are
OL,16,Fboth closed and a cordon is in place,
OL,17,Fwhile Larkhall Leisure Centre is
OL,18,Fbelieved to have been evacuated.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
